  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25600378",
      "title": "Exploring the Redux DevTools",
      "sourceHash": "b76be77eeaa406bb928a55622dc9425ebd04ff08d9192068d5dd752e1df01b4e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.45,
          "en": "So, now our cart is working correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.45,
          "end": 7.43,
          "en": "and we learned a lot about where to put code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.43,
          "end": 9.5,
          "en": "how to run async code with Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.5,
          "end": 11.5,
          "en": "and how to handle side effects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.5,
          "end": 13.22,
          "en": "And we spent a lot of time on that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.22,
          "end": 15.49,
          "en": "because it is an important topic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.49,
          "end": 19.56,
          "en": "and knowing your options there is extremely important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.56,
          "end": 21.1,
          "en": "I can't emphasize this enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.1,
          "end": 24.43,
          "en": "It's important to understand how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.43,
          "end": 28.85,
          "en": "But besides handling async tasks and side effects with Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.85,
          "end": 31.4,
          "en": "and understanding where to put our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.4,
          "end": 33.72,
          "en": "there was another important topic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.72,
          "end": 36.48,
          "en": "I wanted to have a look at in this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 39.46,
          "en": "And that would be the Redux Devtools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.46,
          "end": 42.22,
          "en": "These are extra tools which we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.22,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "which make debugging Redux and our Redux state a bit easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 49.01,
          "en": "Because in more complex applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.01,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "with a lot of Redux state handled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 53.11,
          "en": "by a lot of different slices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.11,
          "end": 55.46,
          "en": "and a lot of different actions going on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.46,
          "end": 59.42,
          "en": "it can be difficult to find errors in your debug state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.42,
          "end": 61.94,
          "en": "in the order of your actions and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.94,
          "end": 64.19,
          "en": "And sometimes it might be interesting to look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.19,
          "end": 67.67,
          "en": "into the current state of your overall Redux store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.67,
          "end": 70.01,
          "en": "without having to dive into different parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.01,
          "end": 74,
          "en": "of the UI to verify that everything works correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74,
          "end": 77.41,
          "en": "And that is what we can use the Redux Devtools for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.41,
          "end": 80.56,
          "en": "You can simply search for Redux Devtools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.56,
          "end": 82.77,
          "en": "and you'll find a GitHub repository",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.77,
          "end": 84.62,
          "en": "about the Redux Devtools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.62,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "and the Redux Devtools can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "and installed as a browser extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 92.27000000000001,
          "en": "You can always install them as a stand alone app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.27000000000001,
          "end": 97.15,
          "en": "but I personally find the browser extension easiest to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 98.27000000000001,
          "en": "So, here I'm on Chrome",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.27000000000001,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "so I'll pick that Chrome browser extension",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 103.75,
          "en": "and here you can install this Chrome extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.75,
          "end": 105.8,
          "en": "Now, I already do have it installed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.8,
          "end": 108.35,
          "en": "You can install it with a click of a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.35,
          "end": 113.35,
          "en": "and once you did so, you will be able to use it right away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.47,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "When using Redux without Redux toolkit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.61,
          "end": 118.91,
          "en": "you had to set up some extra code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.91,
          "end": 121.24,
          "en": "to make Redux Devtools work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.24,
          "end": 125.57,
          "en": "With Redux tool kit it will conveniently work out of the box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.57,
          "end": 128.69,
          "en": "and you should then have access to that extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.69,
          "end": 131.62,
          "en": "Now, here I have an in cognitive tab open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.62,
          "end": 134.17,
          "en": "and there I don't have access to my extensions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.17,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "so, I'll quickly run the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.78,
          "end": 138.2,
          "en": "in a standard Chrome tab again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.2,
          "end": 143.2,
          "en": "and when I do so I have this Redux Devtools icon here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.81,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "or in the browser Devtools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 149.303,
          "en": "you also should find Redux here as an option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.71,
          "end": 152.26,
          "en": "And if you open that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.15,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "it will open this Redux Devtools panel here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 160.75,
          "en": "and now here, you have insights into your Redux store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.75,
          "end": 163.67000000000002,
          "en": "into your actions and much more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.67000000000002,
          "end": 166.28,
          "en": "On the left side, you for example, see the actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.28,
          "end": 167.85,
          "en": "that were dispatched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.85,
          "end": 172.09,
          "en": "And if I reload, we see that's in it and replace cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.09,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "In it, is this automatically dispatched first action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "that applies all your initial states to Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 182.65,
          "en": "so that initializes the store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.65,
          "end": 185.37,
          "en": "and replace card was dispatched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.37,
          "end": 187.563,
          "en": "because we fetched the card initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.47,
          "end": 190.72,
          "en": "Now, if I add something to the card, you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.72,
          "end": 192.92,
          "en": "add item to cart was dispatched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.92,
          "end": 196.71,
          "en": "and our show notification actions which makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.71,
          "end": 198.75,
          "en": "because these are all the actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 198.75,
          "end": 201.91,
          "en": "which are being dispatched when we add an item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 201.91,
          "end": 204.5,
          "en": "First add item to cart it's dispatched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.5,
          "end": 207.46,
          "en": "and when that card state then changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.46,
          "end": 212.46,
          "en": "user App.js kicks in and dispatches send card data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.48,
          "end": 216.47,
          "en": "that's not locked because that itself is not an action type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.47,
          "end": 219.57,
          "en": "but instead as part of send card data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.57,
          "end": 222.57999999999998,
          "en": "we then do dispatch these notification actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 222.57999999999998,
          "end": 225.3,
          "en": "which is why we see them here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.3,
          "end": 228.38,
          "en": "And you can click on those actions to get insights",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.38,
          "end": 232.13,
          "en": "into the data that was transported by that action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.13,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "and how that changed your state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 237.94,
          "en": "You see the data, if you click on action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.94,
          "end": 240.12,
          "en": "there you see the payload off the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 240.12,
          "end": 242.76,
          "en": "and this unique identifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.76,
          "end": 243.9,
          "en": "Here, we can also see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.9,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "the automatically created unique identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "Redux toolkit gives us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 253.66,
          "en": "as you see it's basically your slice name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.66,
          "end": 256.07,
          "en": "So, in card it's this slice name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 256.07,
          "end": 258.91,
          "en": "and then the method name of this reducer method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.91,
          "end": 262.86,
          "en": "that is the unique identifier created by Redux toolkit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.86,
          "end": 264.563,
          "en": "and then here we have our payload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.87,
          "end": 270.37,
          "en": "We also see how the state looks like there after.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 270.37,
          "end": 273.78,
          "en": "So, how the state looks after this action was performed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.78,
          "end": 277.19,
          "en": "and we see how it was updated if we click on diff.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.19,
          "end": 278.53,
          "en": "Therefore add item to cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.53,
          "end": 282.11,
          "en": "we see that the total quantity was changed from six to seven",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.11,
          "end": 286.40999999999997,
          "en": "changed one set from false to true and in the items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.40999999999997,
          "end": 289.28,
          "en": "we see that the quantity of that first item changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.28,
          "end": 290.48,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.48,
          "end": 294.1,
          "en": "So, that's super useful to understand the impact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 294.1,
          "end": 295.14300000000003,
          "en": "of your actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 296.19,
          "end": 300.21,
          "en": "You can even do something which is called time traveling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 300.21,
          "end": 302.66,
          "en": "You can jump to an older state like this one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 302.66,
          "end": 305.18,
          "en": "by clicking on it and then clicking on jump",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 305.18,
          "end": 307.76,
          "en": "and you see now the notification is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 307.76,
          "end": 311.16,
          "en": "and we're back to the card with six items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.16,
          "end": 314.45,
          "en": "And we can then start debugging here again if we want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.45,
          "end": 316.3,
          "en": "and we can then also jump back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 316.3,
          "end": 318.93,
          "en": "to a newer state if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 318.93,
          "end": 321.07,
          "en": "So, that can be really convenient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.07,
          "end": 324.24,
          "en": "and therefore the Redux Devtools are a piece of software",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 324.24,
          "end": 327.91,
          "en": "I can only encourage you to use and play around with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 327.91,
          "end": 331.17,
          "en": "to get deeper insights into your Redux store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.17,
          "end": 333.55,
          "en": "and to debug your Redux behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.55,
          "end": 336.003,
          "en": "and fully understand what's going on.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
